{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":22.08},{"sectionId":"build","start":23.08,"end":34.56},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":36.32,"end":46.8}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":3.6,"text":"靜態網站是一組可由瀏覽器呈現的檔案。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":4.16,"end":7.84,"text":"Python 能在人們開啟網站之前先產生檔案。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.72,"end":13.12,"text":"先用字典串列開始：每個字典描述一件作品，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":13.6,"end":15.6,"text":"串列描述作品集合。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":16.56,"end":19.6,"text":"這個瀏覽器執行器運行標準 Python，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":19.84,"end":22.08,"text":"不會啟動 Flask 伺服器。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":23.08,"end":24,"text":"在 /chapter1."},{"sectionId":"build","start":24.187,"end":27.12,"text":"py 的註解處加入 氣象圖 字典。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":28.08,"end":31.12,"text":"執行後確認印出兩個作品標題。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":32.16,"end":34.56,"text":"哪一個值代表整個作品集合？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":36.32,"end":38.8,"text":"哪一個值代表整個作品集合？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":40.16,"end":43.84,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":44.32,"end":46.8,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}